# Omarchy packages installed explicitly, alongside the desktop set composed from
# the checkout's own lists (docs/plan.md Phase 3).
#
# The runtime and settings are built here from the pinned quattro checkout with
# the vendored aarch64-google patch and come from [platform]; the keyring and the
# editor come from [omarchy]. The desktop set itself (omarchy-base.packages plus
# the aarch64 and platform additions) is not listed here: it is composed at build
# time so it cannot drift from the packages that ship it, exactly as the ISO and
# omarchy-pkg-defaults do.
#
# One package per line; blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored, and
# packages/aarch64-filter.list is applied here too.
omarchy-keyring
omarchy-dev
omarchy-settings-dev
omarchy-nvim
